        "name": "Add timestamp",
        "func": "var now = new Date();\n\nvar options = {\n    timeZone: 'Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh',\n    hour12: false,\n    year: 'numeric',\n    month: '2-digit',\n    day: '2-digit',\n    hour: '2-digit',\n    minute: '2-digit',\n    second: '2-digit'\n};\n\nvar timestampVN = new Intl.DateTimeFormat('vi-VN', options).format(now);\n\n\nvar value = msg.payload;\nvar parts = value.split(',');\n\nmsg.payload = {\n    timestamp: timestampVN,\n    temperature: parseFloat(parts[0]),\n    humidity: parseFloat(parts[1]),\n    soilMoisture: parseInt(parts[2])\n};\n\nmsg.operation = \"insertOne\";\n\nreturn msg;\n",
